---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses, and protects your information, including SMS consent terms.`}>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-site max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="h2 mt-3">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-[15px] text-ink-soft">Effective {site.privacyEffective}</p>

      <div class="prose-site mt-8 text-ink-soft [&_h2]:text-ink [&_h2]:font-semibold [&_h2]:text-xl [&_h2]:mt-10 [&_h2]:mb-3 [&_ul]:list-disc [&_ul]:pl-6 [&_ul]:mb-4 [&_li]:mb-1">
        <p>This policy explains what {site.legalName} ("{site.name}," "I," "we") collects when you use {site.domain} or contact us, how it's used, and the choices you have. Plain language on purpose.</p>

        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>What you send us.</strong> When you fill out a form, you give us your name, email, phone number (optional), company or store URL, revenue range, the platforms you use, and a description of your problem.</li>
          <li><strong>Site usage.</strong> Standard web server logs (IP address, browser, pages visited, referring page) and, once enabled, analytics such as Google Analytics 4 and conversion tracking for advertising platforms.</li>
          <li><strong>Client data during an engagement.</strong> If we work together, you may grant access to systems such as Shopify, email platforms, ad accounts, or spreadsheets. That access is governed by our written agreement and used only to do the work.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>How we use it</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To respond to your request and schedule a call.</li>
          <li>To scope, deliver, and support services you've asked for.</li>
          <li>To understand how the site is used and improve it.</li>
          <li>To send you messages you've agreed to receive (see the SMS section below).</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We don't sell your personal information. We don't share it with third parties for their own marketing.</p>

        <h2 id="sms">SMS / text messaging</h2>
        <p>If you check the SMS consent box on a form at {site.domain}, or call or text our business number, you agree to receive text messages from {site.legalName} ("{site.name}") about your inquiry: scheduling and reminders for calls, follow-up on your request, and updates on services you've asked about. Consent is optional and is not a condition of purchasing any service. The full program terms are in our <a href="/terms#sms" class="link">SMS Terms</a>.</p>
        <p><strong>No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes.</strong> Information sharing with subcontractors in support services, such as customer service, is permitted. Text messaging originator opt-in data and consent will not be shared with any third parties, excluding the platform providers that deliver the messages on our behalf.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Message frequency varies.</strong> Typically a handful of messages related to scheduling and follow-up on your request.</li>
          <li><strong>Message and data rates may apply</strong>, depending on your carrier and plan.</li>
          <li><strong>Reply STOP to opt out</strong> at any time. You'll receive one confirmation message and no further texts. <strong>Reply HELP</strong> for help, or email <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} class="link">{site.contactEmail}</a>.</li>
          <li>Carriers are not liable for delayed or undelivered messages.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>Service providers who help run the business and act on our instructions: website hosting (Cloudflare), CRM and messaging (GoHighLevel), email delivery, analytics (Google), and scheduling tools. Each is bound to use your data only to provide their service to us. We may also disclose information if required by law.</p>

        <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
        <p>The site may use cookies and similar technologies for analytics and advertising measurement. You can block cookies in your browser; the site still works without them.</p>

        <h2>Retention</h2>
        <p>Form submissions and CRM records are kept as long as needed to respond to you and, if we work together, for the duration of the engagement plus the period required for tax and legal records. Ask and we'll delete what we're not required to keep.</p>

        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Ask what we hold about you, correct it, or ask us to delete it: email <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} class="link">{site.contactEmail}</a>.</li>
          <li>Unsubscribe from emails using the link in any email.</li>
          <li>Stop texts by replying STOP.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>We use reputable providers, HTTPS everywhere, and access controls appropriate to a small business. No system is perfectly secure; if a breach affects your data we'll tell you.</p>

        <h2>Children</h2>
        <p>The site is for businesses and isn't directed at anyone under 18. We don't knowingly collect information from children.</p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>If this policy changes, the effective date at the top changes with it. Material changes will be noted on this page.</p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>{site.legalName}<br />{site.mailingAddress}<br /><a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`} class="link">{site.contactEmail}</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
